@startuml twoplayer-class
' 2인용 게임 진행 모델 클래스 다이어그램 (#6)
' 근거: com.holub.life.twoplayer (feature/two-player-mode 86bda26), 003-game-phase.md, 004-player-input.md, 005-cell-count-and-judge.md
' 공개(public) 타입은 흰색, package-private 타입은 회색. 필드·메서드는 실제 코드 이름 그대로.
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK KR"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
set separator none
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
  ArrowColor #444444
}
skinparam class<<package-private>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEEEEE
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBE6
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

title 2인용 게임 진행 모델 (com.holub.life.twoplayer)

package com.holub.life.twoplayer {

  class TwoPlayerGame {
    - board : TwoPlayerBoard
    - settings : GameSettings
    - phase : Phase
    - round : int
    - generationInRound : int
    + TwoPlayerGame(board : TwoPlayerBoard, settings : GameSettings)
    + select(who : Player, row : int, column : int) : Response
    + confirm(who : Player) : Response
    + pass(who : Player) : Response
    + tick() : boolean
    + phase() : PhaseKind
    + currentPlayer() : Player
    + remaining(player : Player) : int
    + round() : int
    + generationInRound() : int
    + tentative() : Optional<Coordinate>
    + score(player : Player) : int
    + result() : Optional<GameResult>
    ~ board() : TwoPlayerBoard
    ~ settings() : GameSettings
    ~ countGeneration()
    ~ startSimulation(newRound : int)
    ~ endSimulation(finishedRound : int, scoreA : int, scoreB : int)
    ~ endGame(result : GameResult)
    ~ endIntervention(finishedRound : int)
  }

  interface TwoPlayerBoard {
    + rows() : int
    + columns() : int
    + isEmpty(row : int, column : int) : boolean
    + hasEmptyCell() : boolean
    + place(row : int, column : int, owner : Player)
    + advanceGeneration()
    + count(owner : Player) : int
  }

  class GameSettings {
    - placements : int
    - generationsPerRound : int
    - interventions : int
    - rounds : int
    + GameSettings(placements : int, generationsPerRound : int, interventions : int, rounds : int)
    + {static} defaults() : GameSettings
    + placements() : int
    + generationsPerRound() : int
    + interventions() : int
    + rounds() : int
  }

  interface Phase <<package-private>> {
    kind() : PhaseKind
    select(who : Player, row : int, column : int) : Response
    confirm(who : Player) : Response
    pass(who : Player) : Response
    tick() : boolean
    currentPlayer() : Player
    remaining(player : Player) : int
    tentative() : Optional<Coordinate>
    result() : Optional<GameResult>
  }

  abstract class PlacingPhase <<package-private>> {
    # game : TwoPlayerGame
    # current : Player
    - remaining : Map<Player, Integer>
    - tentative : Coordinate
    # {abstract} allowsColumn(who : Player, column : int) : boolean
    # {abstract} afterConfirm()
    # clearTentative()
  }

  class InitialPlacementPhase <<package-private>>
  class InterventionPhase <<package-private>> {
    - round : int
    - consecutivePasses : int
    ~ begin()
    - nextTurn()
    - skipPlayersWhoCannotPlace()
    - canPlace(player : Player) : boolean
  }
  class SimulationPhase <<package-private>> {
    - game : TwoPlayerGame
    - round : int
  }
  class GameOverPhase <<package-private>> {
    - result : GameResult
  }

  class GameJudge <<package-private>> {
    ~ {static} afterGeneration(scoreA : int, scoreB : int) : Optional<GameResult>
    ~ {static} afterLastRound(scoreA : int, scoreB : int) : GameResult
  }

  enum Player {
    A
    B
    + opponent() : Player
  }
  enum PhaseKind {
    PLACEMENT
    SIMULATION
    INTERVENTION
    GAME_OVER
  }
  enum Response {
    ACCEPTED
    WRONG_PHASE
    NOT_YOUR_TURN
    OUT_OF_BOARD
    CELL_NOT_EMPTY
    OPPONENT_HALF
    NO_TENTATIVE_PLACEMENT
    PASS_NOT_ALLOWED
  }
  class Coordinate <<record>> {
    + row : int
    + column : int
  }
  class GameResult <<record>> {
    + outcome : Outcome
    + reason : EndReason
    + scoreA : int
    + scoreB : int
  }
  enum Outcome {
    A_WINS
    B_WINS
    DRAW
  }
  enum EndReason {
    WIPE_OUT
    ROUNDS_COMPLETED
  }
}

TwoPlayerGame o--> "1" TwoPlayerBoard
TwoPlayerGame o--> "1" GameSettings
TwoPlayerGame *--> "1" Phase : 현재 단계

Phase <|.. PlacingPhase
PlacingPhase <|-- InitialPlacementPhase
PlacingPhase <|-- InterventionPhase
Phase <|.. SimulationPhase
Phase <|.. GameOverPhase

PlacingPhase --> TwoPlayerGame : game
SimulationPhase --> TwoPlayerGame : game
SimulationPhase ..> GameJudge : afterGeneration
TwoPlayerGame ..> GameJudge : afterLastRound
GameOverPhase --> GameResult
GameResult --> Outcome
GameResult --> EndReason

note right of Phase
  State 패턴 (003).
  TwoPlayerGame의 입력 메서드는
  모두 phase에 위임한다.
end note

note bottom of TwoPlayerBoard
  셀 상태(#5)를 숨기는 인터페이스.
  구현은 #5 이후. 테스트는 StubBoard 대역.
end note

note left of GameJudge
  판정 규칙만 하는 순수 함수 (005).
end note
@enduml
